Package: grams
Type: Package
Title: Generate Anagram Stimuli and Compute String Metrics for Psycholinguistic Research
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Ian R.", "Newman", email = "ian.newman@usask.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools for generating, scoring, and selecting anagram stimuli
    for use in psycholinguistic experiments. Includes functions for computing
    orthographic, phonological, and lexical metrics for anagram candidates,
    and selecting stimuli sets matched on relevant psycholinguistic dimensions.
